      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>one tiny thing feels impossible when the core files are corrupted. it's not just a temporary glitch or a bad day. it's like the foundation is bad. every time i try to reboot or start over, the same errors just keep popping up. i think i'm just beyond repair at this point. the hardware itself is just failing.",
